 "offset_seconds": -3.0200000000001914,
 "words_heard": 308,
 "words": 309,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Naaman stood in power and pride",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 13.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Commander of Aram's army wide",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through him the Lord gave victory",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But leprosy marked his body",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A young girl from Israel's land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Served in Naaman's wife's hand",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She spoke of a prophet in Samaria",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who could heal his skin so badly",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go wash seven times in the Jordan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let your flesh be clean and restored",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The simple word is God's way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace that cannot be bought or paid",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came with horses and chariots",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the door of Elisha's house",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the prophet sent a messenger",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With words that made Naaman frown",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He thought the man would come out",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wave his hand and cure the doubt",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead he was told to dip",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In waters he deemed too small to fix",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go wash seven times in the Jordan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let your flesh be clean and restored",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The simple word is God's way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace that cannot be bought or paid",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His servants spoke with gentle care",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why did you turn away in rage",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If the prophet asked for greatness",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Would you not have done his bidding",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So he went down to the river",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dipped himself seven times in the water",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His flesh was like a young boy's skin",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was clean and he came back in",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go wash seven times in the Jordan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let your flesh be clean and restored",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The simple word is God's way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace that cannot be bought or paid",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I know there is no God in all the earth",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Except in Israel's land",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So please accept a gift from your servant",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For I have found the promise and the plan",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Elisha refused the silver",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying I will accept nothing",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Naaman asked for earth to carry",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So he could serve the Lord forever",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Only Naaman the Syrian was cleansed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While many lepers went unhealed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace found the outsider in the end",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  }
